    <TD align="left" valign="top" colspan="4" height="115"><b>Mauss was born in South Qeynos.  From an early age, his parents could tell that he would be trouble.  Year after year he become more sullen and brooding.  After beating his cousin to death over a stick of cinnamon at age 9, his parents were horrified.  They sent him to study with the Brothers of The Silent Fist Clan hoping that they could quell the evil in his heart.

Unfortunately all the Clan did was create a highly disciplined killing machine.

Ten years later, against the better judgement of his parents and the citizens of Qeynos, Mauss was expelled from the Clan and banished from Qeynos.  He headed into the Hills and beyond, killing what he could and looting the lifeless bodies.  He never looked back and never felt remorse.

Over the last few years, he has come to realize that he needs and even wants friends.  A loner for most of his life, he now enjoys the company of others who share the same love of killing.  Some call it justice, some call it good vs. evil; he calls it fun.

He also found new feelings such as Trust and Loyalty.  Because of this, he accepted an invitation to become a charter member and officer of the Guild.  And although not sure what to make of him, both the Ashen Order and The Silent Fist Clan now claim him as a Brother.

Just don’t look behind the curtain…
</b></TD>
